{"title":"Words of wisdom","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/926559635/0/marginalrevolution~Words-of-wisdom.html","date":1761030407000,"content":"<blockquote><p><span>Among these changes, the most underrated is not misinformation or kooky conspiracy theories or even populism per se — it’s </span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F0ce3a639-8a8f-4230-8cc3-c02745733c6b%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C81c3ee31b2ec4774fad908de0fc5895d%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638965538271680327%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=U1jj2F2z5TLHdJQNyE7vnQxv34jYNjFPfv%2FADzTHTt8%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">relentless negativity</a>. One thing that we’ve learned from revealed preferences on the internet is that <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2F96411355-c354-463f-b335-3a7701e95ad0%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C81c3ee31b2ec4774fad908de0fc5895d%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638965538271693288%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=G73ykZXZJ7rlad12JHWRMy2DKGq2%2FSI2WBQlrchvKl0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">negativity-inflected stories perform better</a>…</p>\r\n<p><span>The impact of ultra-negativity is symmetrical in the sense that both sides do it, but it’s asymmetrical in the sense that </span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack.com%2Fredirect%2Fd5c5c337-9c07-4cd6-8bd0-4704ff041727%3Fj%3DeyJ1IjoiM285In0.FYORq_H-OKLpmdRjBukHHZzTJ6NOFfwRxYngojeKDOQ&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C81c3ee31b2ec4774fad908de0fc5895d%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638965538271774786%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=biL7O6%2FFeS5aiu7aDWyhB%2BJbEUdd%2Fmn%2F1r5KHEm1%2FUk%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">conservatives outnumber progressives</a>. In practice, oscillating extremism results in a right-wing authoritarian regime, not a left-wing one.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.slowboring.com/p/more-streaming-video-is-bad?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=159185&amp;post_id=176264389&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=false&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">from the gated Matt Yglesias</a>.  The important thing is to keep a positive, constructive attitude toward what is possible.  Content creators who do not do that, no matter what their professed views, are supporting the darker sides of MAGA.</p>\r\n<p>So keep up the good work people!</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html\">Words of wisdom</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/926559635/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/926559635/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/926559635/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/926559635/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/926559635/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/926559635/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html#comment-160976081\">In reply to Some Toronto Guy.   Who would buy Canadian made ...</a> <i>by Jim</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html#comment-160976073\">In reply to RAD.   NAFTA was a mistake from the start, and ...</a> <i>by Some Toronto Guy</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html#comment-160976071\">In reply to Moses Taylor.   This is exactly what I expect out ...</a> <i>by Some Toronto Guy</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html#comment-160976062\">Dude as much as I agree with you on trusting Lutnick or Trump, ...</a> <i>by Jim</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/10/words-of-wisdom-17.html#comment-160976040\">In reply to RAD.   Do we know how easy is it for Trump to end ...</a> <i>by Jim</i><